            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f'(x)=e^x-3e^{-x}=\\frac{(e^x)^2-3}{e^x}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(e^x>0\\) なので、\\(f'(x)=0\\) は \\(e^x=\\sqrt3\\) と同値です。したがって",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x=\\log\\sqrt3=\\frac12\\log3",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "この前後で \\(f'(x)\\) は負から正へ変わるので、ここで最小です。\\(e^x=\\sqrt3\\) を元の関数へ代入します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f(x)=\\sqrt3+\\frac3{\\sqrt3}=2\\sqrt3",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "別の確認",
            "text": "\\(e^x>0\\)、\\(3e^{-x}>0\\) なので、相加・相乗平均でも最小値 \\(2\\sqrt3\\) を確認できます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問2　中心をずらして回転する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "回転の中心が \\(\\beta\\) なので、まず \\(\\alpha-\\beta\\) で中心を原点へ移します。\\(\\pi/4\\) の回転因子は \\((1+i)/\\sqrt2\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "z-\\beta=(\\alpha-\\beta)\\frac{1+i}{\\sqrt2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "z=(\\alpha-\\beta)\\frac{1+i}{\\sqrt2}+\\beta",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "saitama-medical-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p002",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(\\alpha-\\beta=(2+i)-(1-2i)=1+3i\\) を代入して展開します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(1+3i)\\frac{1+i}{\\sqrt2}=\\frac{-2+4i}{\\sqrt2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{-2+4i}{\\sqrt2}=-\\sqrt2+2\\sqrt2i",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "z=1-\\sqrt2+2(\\sqrt2-1)i",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "z=(\\sqrt2-1)(-1+2i)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "第1問の確認",
            "text": "回転では「中心を引く、回転因子を掛ける、中心を足す」の順を崩さないことが大切です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第2問　動いた距離を文字で置いて平方完成する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "問1",
                "value": "8 1 ／ 9 5 ／ 10 5 ／ 11 2"
              },
              {
                "label": "問2",
                "value": "12 7 ／ 13 1 ／ 14 0"
              },
              {
                "label": "問3",
                "value": "15 1 ／ 16 0 ／ 17 2 ／ 18 2 ／ 19 1 ／ 20 − ／ 21 5 ／ 22 2"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問1　同じ速さで動く",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(P,Q\\) が動いた距離を同じ文字 \\(a\\) で置きます。すると \\(P(10-a,0)\\)、\\(Q(0,20-a)\\) です。距離そのものではなく、平方を最小にします。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "PQ^2=(10-a)^2+(20-a)^2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "PQ^2=2a^2-60a+500",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "PQ^2=2(a-15)^2+50",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "平方の部分が0になる \\(a=15\\) で最小となり、その距離は \\(\\sqrt{50}=5\\sqrt2\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問2　速さが3倍",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(P\\) の移動距離を \\(b\\) とすると、\\(Q\\) の移動距離は \\(3b\\) です。したがって \\(P(10-b,0)\\)、\\(Q(0,20-3b)\\) と置きます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "PQ^2=(10-b)^2+(20-3b)^2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "PQ^2=10b^2-140b+500",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "PQ^2=10(b-7)^2+10",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "saitama-medical-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p003",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "平方完成から \\(b=7\\) のときに最小となり、最短距離は \\(\\sqrt{10}\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問3　速さを \\(k\\) 倍へ一般化する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(P\\) の移動距離を \\(d\\) とすると、\\(Q\\) の移動距離は \\(kd\\) です。よって \\(P(10-d,0)\\)、\\(Q(0,20-kd)\\) となります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "PQ^2=(10-d)^2+(20-kd)^2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "PQ^2=(1+k^2)d^2-20(1+2k)d+500",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "PQ^2=(1+k^2)\\left\\{d-\\frac{10(1+2k)}{1+k^2}\\right\\}^2+C",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "C=500-\\frac{\\{10(1+2k)\\}^2}{1+k^2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "したがって、距離が最小になる移動量は",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "d=\\frac{10(2k+1)}{k^2+1}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "次に \\(f(k)=(2k+1)/(k^2+1)\\) と置き、この分数関数を最大にします。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f'(k)=\\frac{-2(k^2+k-1)}{(k^2+1)^2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(k>0\\) なので、\\(f'(k)=0\\) の解は \\(k=(-1+\\sqrt5)/2\\) だけです。増減が正から負へ変わるため、ここで最大です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "k=\\frac{-1+\\sqrt5}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第3問　円周角から直交を見抜き、相似へつなぐ",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "問1",
                "value": "23 − ／ 24 1"
              },
              {
                "label": "問2",
                "value": "25 3 ／ 26 2 ／ 27 3"
              },
              {
                "label": "問3",
                "value": "28 2 ／ 29 3 ／ 30 3 ／ 31 3"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "saitama-medical-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p004",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問1　直径に対する円周角を使う",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q3-geometry-1",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(OA=OB=OC=1\\) なので、\\(BC\\) は単位円の直径です。直径に対する円周角より \\(\\angle BPC=\\pi/2\\) となり、\\(\\ell\\perp\\ell'\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\ell'\\text{ の傾き}=-\\frac1t",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問2　相似を作って面積比を辺比へ変える",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "直線の式は \\(\\ell:y=tx-1\\)、\\(\\ell':y=-x/t+1\\) なので、\\(Q(1/t,0)\\)、\\(S(t,0)\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(\\angle PBC=\\alpha\\)、\\(\\angle PCB=\\beta\\) と置きます。直角三角形より \\(\\alpha+\\beta=\\pi/2\\) で、\\(\\triangle PBC\\) と \\(\\triangle PQS\\) の角がそれぞれ一致します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "saitama-medical-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p005",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "さらに \\(BC\\parallel RT\\) から対応する角も確認できるので、\\(\\triangle PBC\\sim\\triangle PQS\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q3-geometry-2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "相似な三角形の面積比は、対応する辺の比の2乗です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{\\triangle PBC}{\\triangle PQS}=\\left(\\frac{BC}{QS}\\right)^2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{BC}{QS}=\\frac2{t-1/t}=\\frac{2t}{t^2-1}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "面積比が3で \\(t>1\\) なので、辺比は正の \\(\\sqrt3\\) を取ります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{2t}{t^2-1}=\\sqrt3",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\sqrt3t^2-2t-\\sqrt3=0,\\qquad t=\\sqrt3",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(t=\\tan(\\pi/2-\\beta)=\\sqrt3\\) より \\(\\beta=\\pi/6\\)、\\(\\alpha=\\pi/3\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\angle ATP=\\pi-\\alpha=\\frac23\\pi",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "別解",
            "text": "原本には、\\(P\\) の座標を2直線の交点として求め、座標から2つの三角形の面積比を作る別解もあります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "saitama-medical-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p006",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "別解では \\(P\\) を \\(\\ell\\) と \\(\\ell'\\) の交点として求めます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "P\\left(\\frac{2t}{t^2+1},\\frac{t^2-1}{t^2+1}\\right)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\triangle PBC=\\frac{2t}{t^2+1}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\triangle PQS=\\frac{(t^2-1)^2}{2t(t^2+1)}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{\\triangle PBC}{\\triangle PQS}=\\frac{4t^2}{(t^2-1)^2}=3",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(t>1\\) を使うと \\(t^2=3\\)、すなわち \\(t=\\sqrt3\\) が得られ、角度も \\(2\\pi/3\\) と確認できます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問3　相似と三角比で線分を求める",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "問2で得た \\(\\alpha=\\pi/3\\)、\\(\\beta=\\pi/6\\) を使います。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{BP}{BC}=\\cos\\alpha=\\frac12,\\qquad \\frac{SA}{ST}=\\cos\\beta=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(BC=2\\)、\\(SA=\\sqrt3-1\\) なので、\\(BP=1\\)、\\(BS=2\\)、\\(ST=2-2/\\sqrt3\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "PT=BS-(BP+ST)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "PT=\\frac2{\\sqrt3}-1=\\frac{2-\\sqrt3}{\\sqrt3}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "saitama-medical-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p007",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "PT=\\frac{2\\sqrt3-3}{3}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "別解",
            "text": "原本の別解では \\(P(\\sqrt3/2,1/2)\\)、\\(T(1,1-1/\\sqrt3)\\) を求め、2点間の距離から同じ \\(PT\\) を得ます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "第3問の確認",
            "text": "問1の直交関係を問2の相似へ、問2の角度を問3の長さへ引き継ぐ流れです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第4問　仕切り法で非負整数解を数える",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "問1",
                "value": "32 1 ／ 33 0 ／ 34 0 ／ 35 1"
              },
              {
                "label": "問2",
                "value": "36 6 ／ 37 1 ／ 38 2 ／ 39 3"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "見分けがつかない品物を5人へ0個以上分ける問題は、非負整数解の個数です。\\(n\\) 個の○と4本の仕切りを並べます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a_n={}_{n+4}\\mathrm C_4",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a_n=\\frac{(n+4)(n+3)(n+2)(n+1)}{4\\cdot3\\cdot2\\cdot1}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "4人へ分ける場合は仕切りが3本なので",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "b_n={}_{n+3}\\mathrm C_3",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "b_n=\\frac{(n+3)(n+2)(n+1)}{3\\cdot2\\cdot1}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "saitama-medical-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p008",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問1　10個を5人へ分ける",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "5人の個数を \\(a,b,c,d,e\\) とすると、\\(a+b+c+d+e=10\\) の非負整数解を数えます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a_{10}={}_{14}\\mathrm C_4",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a_{10}=\\frac{14\\cdot13\\cdot12\\cdot11}{4\\cdot3\\cdot2\\cdot1}=1001",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問2　Aの個数を固定する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(A\\) に \\(k\\) 個渡すと、残る \\(10-k\\) 個を \\(B,C,D,E\\) の4人へ分けます。したがって4変数の非負整数解です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "b_{10-k}={}_{13-k}\\mathrm C_3",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\begin{aligned}b_{10-k}&=\\frac16(10-k+1)(10-k+2)\\\\&\\quad\\times(10-k+3)\\end{aligned}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "第4問の確認",
            "text": "人数が5人なら仕切り4本、1人分を固定して残り4人なら仕切り3本です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      }
